  "notes": "Cause code X (Other) reflects that no root cause for the relay coil failure could be determined despite engineering evaluation; theme captures the undetermined-mechanism nature. No previous similar events were identified at BFN within three years, so no stub LER/SIMILAR_TO edge was created. Division II outages for testing (~78 hours total) are the basis for the PRA exposure period; Division II is modeled as a backup system since it was explicitly stated to be available except during those testing periods. Unit 2's improper Mode 2/1 entry on 2021-04-21 in violation of LCO 3.0.4 is captured within the TS-violation consequence node rather than as a separate consequence, since it stems from the same underlying inoperability."
